Fill each field the form asks for with fill_from_identity(ref, field, selector), using the field key; for a date of birth split into three selects, call it once per select with part "day", "month" or "year". You never see a value and you never type one yourself: not from the goal, a memory or the page. A field with usableHere false is saved but not allowed on this site: fill_from_identity then asks the owner. If a field the form needs is not listed at all, ask the owner once for all missing details together (request_human, input "text").",
