        {
          "description": "List the payment cards the owner allowed at the shop now on screen: none, or \`{ ref, name, brand, last4, limit, expires, securityCode }\` per card. You never see a card number, an expiry or a code, and you never type one yourself. Call it on the shop's checkout page before paying.",
