        {
          "description": "Say what you are about to pay, BEFORE typing a card: the exact total you read on the page (a decimal such as 42.50), its currency (ISO 4217, such as USD) and what is being bought. The system records it, shows it to the owner in the approval and checks it against the owner's limit. The shop is the page now on screen. Nothing is typed without it.",
          "name": "declare_charge",
